Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand your ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That beast must not advance\Nbeyond the palace walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.93,0:01:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take him down at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had the strength to\Nsummon a creature of my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.31,0:01:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Zork would easily fall at the\Nhands of the White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.73,0:01:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisara, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.03,0:01:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that Zork's resurrection has\Nbrought out the worst of both worlds Enough
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.85,0:01:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,As the world of the ancient\Npast sinks deeper into the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.89,0:01:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Darkness. So does its present-day\Ncounterpart. And before long,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,neither one will exist
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And the best party is it's all your fault\NHad you not traveled back in time to learn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.97,0:01:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,about your past I wouldn't have been able\Nto join you And to make matters worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:01:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you're the only one who can stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:01:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But you never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.17,0:02:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't seem to remember the magic word.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to defeating Zok.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.57,0:02:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your own name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.57,0:02:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is someone out there with the\Ncourage and determination to find it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.03,0:02:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a reason he and\NI were brought together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.75,0:02:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can rescue mankind\Nfrom the evil forces
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.57,0:02:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,that scoundrels like you seek to unleash
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.99,0:02:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not only Yugi you need to worry\Nabout I have all of my friends by my side
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you enter the Shadow Realm\NSo will they And for that matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.13,0:02:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so will the rest of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.55,0:02:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.01,0:02:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Our defenses are too weak, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.51,0:03:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All the armies in the world\Ncouldn't stop the Dark One.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.87,0:03:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.29,0:03:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to conquer\Na creature as powerful as Zork.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.77,0:03:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You must summon the three Egyptian gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.57,0:03:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But Shimon, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Not without my Millennium puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.41,0:03:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, look at my wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.09,0:03:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My energy is much too low.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Without those items, none of\Nus has the strength we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we must search the\Ndesert until we find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But haven't they been destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.41,0:03:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.23,0:03:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When Zork first arrived in our world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.65,0:03:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the seven Millennium items were\Nscattered throughout the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can just locate\Nthem, we may be able to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.19,0:03:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,save egypt fine then\Ni'll go no you have other
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.63,0:03:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,matters to tend to my pharaoh these brave
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.23,0:03:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,soldiers are depending\Nupon their king for support
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:04:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,trust me with spiria as my guide i know\Ni can locate those items i won't fail you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.15,0:04:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And neither will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.89,0:04:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.91,0:04:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, if Mahad were\Nhere, he'd want me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.11,0:04:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.79,0:04:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Pharaoh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you, go. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take the south route\Nand we'll distract Zorg.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Seto. Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike on my command!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.25,0:04:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We must divert its attention! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.59,0:04:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth, guardian of the fortress!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:04:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis, your energy level's too low!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.51,0:05:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.85,0:05:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew you'd get this far without\Nthe pharaoh holding your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.43,0:05:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,When the fate of the world's at stake,\Nyou'd be surprised how well I can duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe, Dad's telling him, Yugi! You go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.99,0:05:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell your little fan\Nclub to settle down back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.43,0:05:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll start by activating this\Nmagic card, Spirit Sword of Sealing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows me to choose\Nany one of your monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,currently in play and instantly\Nremove it from the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.09,0:05:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my silent swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I'm afraid you can't rescue him\Nusing magic, trap, or monster effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.17,0:05:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor can your swordsman\Nuse its own abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.67,0:05:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's just the\Nbeginning of my comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.55,0:05:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I summon my\Ndisgraced mage in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:06:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my mage, attack his\NMarshmallon with Doomstaff Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.79,0:06:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You activated my monster's special effect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know by now it\Ncan't be destroyed in battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.05,0:06:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and what a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it was your mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.33,0:06:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Because had your pink mucus\Nmonster gone to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.97,0:06:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,your captive swordsman\Nwould have been set free!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.07,0:06:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,any monster imprisoned by the\NSpirit Sword of Sealing is
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.17,0:06:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,automatically released when\Nanother monster belonging to the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Cardholder is destroyed. Too\Nbad, but it appears the special
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,ability of your marshmallow\Nactually backfired this time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you could have used the Pharaoh's\Nhelp after all, you pathetic mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,something's just not right about\Nbekora and this is something
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.63,0:06:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,you just noticed now he's\Nnuts And he'll always be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's weird that\Nhe called Yugi a pathetic mortal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He said it as if he\Nwasn't human or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.41,0:07:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, there's\Nsomething different about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.73,0:07:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough damage for one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then here I go. Now! Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.71,0:07:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you weren't counting on your silent\Nswordsman strength to increase again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you'd be quite disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For my spirit sword prevents that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.27,0:07:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon my Blockin' into Finch Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.49,0:07:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But that thing's only got 300 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.57,0:07:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Yugi thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.59,0:07:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn! So,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.47,0:07:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,just when I thought your deck of miniature\Nmisfits couldn't possibly get any worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you play that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.09,0:07:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's turn up the heat, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, disgraced mage, roast\Nthat marshmallow on your stick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.41,0:07:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.39,0:07:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I will, but do\Nsomething, Yook! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, to eliminate the\Nremainder of your life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:07:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Blockin's ability just kicked in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When one of my monsters is under attack,\NBlockin steps in and takes the hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.23,0:08:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that a monster was\Nsent to Yu-Gi's graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Vakura's spirit sword is deactivated,\Nso Yu-Gi's swordsman is back in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.93,0:08:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As usual, you people don't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.53,0:08:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever my disgraced mage defeats\Nanother monster in a battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.77,0:08:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,that monster goes back to the\Nplayer's deck, not to his grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.03,0:08:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, your\Nswordsman is still trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, if this keeps up, then Yugi\Nwon't be able to use his best monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,True, but thanks to Blockin's\Nspecial effect, I'm not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Because whenever it's destroyed in battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm able to summon a monster known\Nas Lengard to take its place!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the worst deck I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've placed three cards face down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.97,0:09:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you were a Millennium\NItem, where would you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.63,0:09:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.81,0:09:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.99,0:09:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium Scale,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.85,0:09:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium Rod, Millennium Ring, Millennium\NPuzzle, Millennium Eye, Millennium Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.93,0:09:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And thank goodness, my\NMillennium Necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.21,0:09:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to lose. Let's go! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.39,0:09:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you poor fool not only have you failed the\Npharaoh you've let down the entire world
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.71,0:09:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,not yet watch this marshmallow attack his
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.45,0:10:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,disgraced mage as i was saying game over
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,he lost no what have
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you done i activated my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,len guard special ability\Nwhenever one of my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.13,0:10:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters is damaged the\Nresult is automatically
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.33,0:10:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,transferred to lingard so\Nmy life points are safe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.31,0:10:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and now that one of my monsters\Nwas sent to the graveyard the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,special effect of your sword\Nis over and my silent swordsman
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,is free oh yeah so that was\Nyuki's plan all along now silent
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.35,0:10:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,swordsman destroy his mage\Nwith silent sword slash attack
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.13,0:10:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, life points didn't budge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How observant of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monsters aren't the only\Nones with special effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My disgraced mage came complete with\Na little life-saving trick of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.21,0:10:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever it's destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:11:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can avoid losing any life points by\Nreturning my entire hand to my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they'll never escape from this tomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.09,0:11:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,which means the Pharaoh will\Nnever learn his true name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to stay focused and never give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what And if\Nthe Pharaoh were here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.47,0:11:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,he'd say the same thing Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start by activating\Nthe magic card. Part of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Green Which lets me draw\Ntwo more cards from my deck
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.09,0:11:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I reveal my face-down\Ncard The Cursed Twin Dolls
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.39,0:11:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.49,0:11:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I never played\Nwith dolls. As you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.79,0:11:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,each one of these two\Nprecious playmates is carrying
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A gift box, one of which\Ncontains a curse. Now which
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,gift are you going to\Nchoose i guess i've got a 50
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,50 shot of getting this\Nright so here goes all right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll take the red one\Nthen the black box goes to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.99,0:12:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,me let's begin with the\Ncontents of yours it appears
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.13,0:12:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you've chosen wisely now\Nevery time a card is sent
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.01,0:12:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,to the graveyard you shall\Nreceive 200 extra points
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.67,0:12:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, way to pick them, Yuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, time to see what's in your box!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's a curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as this curse is released,\Nmy graveyard will be no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.88,0:12:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can you duel with no graveyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.67,0:12:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Those monsters have been destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Right you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I no longer have a graveyard,\Nthey've returned to the field as phantoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do I look like a human shield to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.11,0:12:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lie to\Nyou, Tay, I guess you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.59,0:12:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Though they're on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.03,0:12:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,these phantom creatures aren't\Nable to attack or defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.37,0:13:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, they're\Nof no threat to you. Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.81,0:13:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Lastly, I'll play my necro\Nsoldier in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's up to something, but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.47,0:13:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Isis, we're not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.35,0:13:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Zork hasn't made it past\Nthe palace gates yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.33,0:13:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish mortals, those millennium\Nitems are powerless against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.81,0:13:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.55,0:13:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with Zork. You get\Nthese items to the Pharaoh. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you fight him alone, Mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.19,0:13:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,if the Pharaoh doesn't get these\Nitems All hope is lost, now go Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.71,0:14:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but This is not up for debate I\Nappreciate your courage But right
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,now you have an important task to\Ncomplete and time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.63,0:14:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the world is at stake\Nin your places with the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad would have said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium necklace, grant me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.05,0:14:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot hide from me, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.31,0:14:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense your presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.01,0:14:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,For that, you shall pay with your soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.73,0:14:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I am truly sorry, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.31,0:14:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I shall join the\Nothers in the Realm of Shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.17,0:15:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.81,0:15:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Fare thee well, Shimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.23,0:15:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Isis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.75,0:15:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.43,0:15:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis may have been absorbed by the\Nshadows just like Karim and Shadda,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but there is a way to rescue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.81,0:15:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,By defeating Zork.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.85,0:15:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm buying some more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.39,0:15:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Before Shaddaa, I was the guardian\Nof the Millennium Key. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.49,0:15:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take these to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.39,0:15:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Please grant this old man's\Nstrength one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.65,0:16:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, with the power of the Sacred\NMillennium Key, I call upon the Forbidden One!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.05,0:16:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, the Great\NDefender of Egypt, Exodia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.17,0:16:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Forbidden One.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.15,0:16:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A beast so powerful it was able to defeat\Nan army of thousands in a single night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Had it not been for you, old friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,this land would surely have fallen\Nat the hands of its enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to your incredible strength, I\Nsealed you within five stone tablets,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,vowing never to release you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.13,0:17:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I lift that seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as powerful as Zork. Let's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia, how do you expect to overpower me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.41,0:17:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You draw your strength from the\Nlife force of a single human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.59,0:17:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My power is derived from\Nthe very darkness itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, observe what the life\Nforce of a single human can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.15,0:18:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.17,0:18:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia, obliterate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shimon, can he truly defeat Zork?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.61,0:18:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia, burn through the darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.15,0:18:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I implore thee with\Nevery ounce of my spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There is not a creature in\Nexistence that can overcome me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.49,0:18:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My power is infinite!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.65,0:18:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, I failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Shimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.09,0:18:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.74,0:18:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Opposing me is futile. I\Nam the embodiment of pure
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,darkness And as your world\Nis enveloped by the shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.61,0:19:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,my power shall grow Now\Nkneel before your new master
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.81,0:19:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.72,0:19:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the light of hope still shines\Nupon the people of Egypt
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.55,0:19:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And that light can illuminate\Neven the darkest of shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.05,0:19:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.61,0:19:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this You found my puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.81,0:19:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis and Shimon surrendered\Ntheir spirits to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.27,0:19:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the Shadow Realm so I\Ncould bring it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.57,0:19:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you their actions\Nwill not be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sork!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.25,0:19:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I face you not alone\Nbut with the spirits of
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.77,0:19:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,those who gave up so\Nmuch to restore peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.63,0:19:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of the people\Nof Egypt, I shall prevail!
